  "details": "camera bug, can't grab the selfie stick itself, but can grab the camera from the same distance so long as it's not where the selfie stick would be. the buttons are really hard to press on it, you have to be way too precise to hit any of them. when i chose the video camera in my setting it goes to the camera, can't more the camera dot around when it's detached from my camera. there doesn't seem to be an easy way to choose when my photos save.\n\nsettings bug, when updating the game it automatically forced me to use the old button system. \n\nhome, who thought that having none current videos was a good idea, why would i want to see how to use the old menu system.\n\n\nfirst picture is the furthest out i can grab the camera.\n\nsecond picture is my trying to select the camera dot.",
